MinIO client (mc)
-----------------
The agent container image bundles the MinIO client (/usr/local/bin/mc) so object migration can mirror buckets between
two S3 endpoints in a helper container of the agent's own image. It is the unmodified upstream release binary, pinned to
a release and verified against a sha256 at image build time (see deploy/Dockerfile.agent), and it is only executed as a
separate program (never linked into Tugra code).
  Source:  https://github.com/minio/mc (release RELEASE.2025-08-13T08-35-41Z)
  License: GNU Affero General Public License v3.0, https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.html
           (source for the shipped binary: https://github.com/minio/mc/tree/RELEASE.2025-08-13T08-35-41Z)
MinIO is a trademark of MinIO, Inc.; the name is used here only to identify the software.

IP geolocation database
-----------------------
The agent container image bundles the DB-IP Lite Country database
(/usr/share/tugra/geoip/country.mmdb), downloaded at image build time and read
locally by the agent; it is never fetched at runtime.
  Source:  https://db-ip.com (IP Geolocation by DB-IP)
  Data:    Copyright (c) 2019-2026 DB-IP
  License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0),
           https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

World map data
--------------
apps/web/src/lib/geo/world-countries-110m.json is the Natural Earth 1:110m
country boundary dataset, public domain, via the world-atlas dataset. It is
bundled as a static file; the map never fetches geography at runtime.
